==Battleground==
*15 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**8 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
**2 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]]s spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is entirely composed of Red and Behemoth enemies, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] will absolutely carry the stage due to their [[Massive Damage]] and [[Behemoth Slayer]]. Just make sure to bring something for the Bore, like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]].

